    "v_14cd34bc9dfbf0fb_u01"
  ],
  "duration_s": 397.586207,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "前两集我们讲了茅以生花九百二十五天，建成钱塘江大桥通车八十九天。含泪亲手炸掉的故事，也讲了这座桥，前前后后被炸了四次，被称为桥坚强的传奇。今天，毛以生系列大结局，我们讲最燃的部分毛以生兑现承诺了一九四六年春天抗战胜利后的第第二年，毛以生回到了节后的杭州。站在钱塘江边看着被炸的断壁残垣的大桥，他想起了九年前闸桥那晚写下的十个字，抗战必胜，此桥必复现在抗战胜利了，该修复桥了。交通部的命令也到了修桥可摆在毛以生，面前的是一个烂摊子，而且是三重烂摊子，第一重无五孔，钢良在江底躺了八九年了得一段一段打捞上来，弯了的矫正，断了的地方换新的铆钉，一颗一颗打回去。好在当年设计师十六孔全是等跨，每孔六十七米统一制造。这时候救了命，打捞上来的钢粮能配得上新造的第二重。日本人当年凑合休往桥里填，劣质砂石，结歪斜，钢梁全得拆掉重来。日本人干的活，毛以生看不上，必须推倒重来。第三重最要命。五号六号，墩伤在水下钱塘江水急潮翻涌，怎么在水下修桥墩？这时候，毛以生的团队总工程师汪菊潜带着一批年轻人，硬是发明了套箱法，做一个巨大的钢筋混凝土箱子，沉下去，把桥墩套住，排干水，在无水的房间里修复墩身。你想想那个画面几十米深的江底，一个巨大的箱子，把桥墩罩住水排干了，工人在里面像在陆地上一样施工，外面是滔滔江水，里面是汗花似溅这套技术，后来成了中国桥梁修水下桥墩的看家本领。直到今天，中国修水下桥墩用的还是这套思路的升级版。一九四七年三月，大桥临时通车，一九四八年五月正式开始修复。注意这个时间，从设计到炸毁，再到修复三个关键节点，全是毛蚁生亲自修复完的世界桥梁。史上找不出第二个人自己设计的桥，自己炸的，自己再修回来，这不是电影剧本，这是真实发生的事儿。可你以为这就完了没有？一九四九年五月，杭州在被解放前夕撤退的军队又炸了一次。好在地下党员和护桥工人拼死保护，只炸毁了部分铁轨。大桥主体保住了新中国，成立后继续修复。一九五三年九月六号，墩彻底修完嗯一九五四年大桥全面恢复使用，从一九三四年开工到一九五四年，全面恢复整整二十年。一座桥折腾了二十年之久，而毛以生的故事还在继续。新中国成立后，毛以生又主持了武汉长江大桥的技术工作。万里长江第一桥在他手里架了起来，从此京汉铁路和粤汉铁路连成一线，整个中国的南北动脉被全面打通了。后来，人民大会堂的建设，中国铁道科学研究院的组建，上百万字的科普著作，毛以生都注入了大量心血。一九八七年九十一岁的毛以生递交了入党申请书，他在申请书里写，我已年逾九十，能为党工作之日日短，而要求入党之殷切，愿望与日俱增。两年后，一九八九年十一月十二日，毛以身世事，享年九十三岁。二零零六年，中国科学院把一颗小行星永久命名为。毛蚁生心，今天钱塘江大桥依然横跨在钱塘江面上上面跑汽车下面跑火车，天天有火车呼啸而过。这座桥的设计寿命其实只有五十年，到今天它已经服役快九十年了。钱塘江大桥陈列馆里至今摆着一段被打捞上来的钢梁，断口的痕迹清清楚楚。那是历史的商吧，也是民族的勋章。有人问茅以生，这辈子图什么？图的就是四个字，此桥必覆他把这四个字刻进骨头里，然后用后半辈子证明了一件事，中国人能建桥赶炸桥更修的回来。从钱塘江到长江，从内河到跨海，今天的中国，拥有世界上最长的跨海大桥，好最高的桥梁，最多的特大桥梁，全球排名前一百的高桥，中国战狼八十多岁。而这一切的起点，就在一九三四年的钱塘江边，在那个叫毛以生的人说出我来的那一刻，毛以生系列到这儿就全部讲完了。三座桥一个人一辈子。如果你也为这个用一生兑现承诺的老人打动了点个赞，收藏起来转发给更多人看看。关注我下一个国之脊梁，我们继续讲。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14cd34bc9dfbf0fb_s00001",
      "start_ms": 130,
      "end_ms": 3210,
      "text": "前两集我们讲了茅以生花九百二十五天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14cd34bc9dfbf0fb_s00002",
      "start_ms": 3270,
      "end_ms": 6930,
      "text": "建成钱塘江大桥通车八十九天。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14cd34bc9dfbf0fb_s00003",
      "start_ms": 6990,
      "end_ms": 9150,
      "text": "含泪亲手炸掉的故事，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14cd34bc9dfbf0fb_s00004",
      "start_ms": 9690,
      "end_ms": 10950,
      "text": "也讲了这座桥，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14cd34bc9dfbf0fb_s00005",
      "start_ms": 11070,
      "end_ms": 13230,
      "text": "前前后后被炸了四次，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14cd34bc9dfbf0fb_s00006",
      "start_ms": 13950,
      "end_ms": 17010,
      "text": "被称为桥坚强的传奇。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14cd34bc9dfbf0fb_s00007",
      "start_ms": 18150,
      "end_ms": 18630,
      "text": "今天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14cd34bc9dfbf0fb_s00008",
      "start_ms": 18730,
      "end_ms": 20310,
      "text": "毛以生系列大结局，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14cd34bc9dfbf0fb_s00009",
      "start_ms": 20690,
      "end_ms": 30600,
      "text": "我们讲最燃的部分毛以生兑现承诺了一九四六年春天抗战胜利后的第第二年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14cd34bc9dfbf0fb_s00010",
      "start_ms": 31080,
      "end_ms": 33460,
      "text": "毛以生回到了节后的杭州。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14cd34bc9dfbf0fb_s00011",
      "start_ms": 34140,
      "end_ms": 38840,
      "text": "站在钱塘江边看着被炸的断壁残垣的大桥，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14cd34bc9dfbf0fb_s00012",
      "start_ms": 39040,
      "end_ms": 42620,
      "text": "他想起了九年前闸桥那晚写下的十个字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14cd34bc9dfbf0fb_s00013",
      "start_ms": 42980,
      "end_ms": 44180,
      "text": "抗战必胜，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14cd34bc9dfbf0fb_s00014",
      "start_ms": 44640,
      "end_ms": 48120,
      "text": "此桥必复现在抗战胜利了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14cd34bc9dfbf0fb_s00015",
      "start_ms": 48360,
      "end_ms": 49440,
      "text": "该修复桥了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14cd34bc9dfbf0fb_s00016",
      "start_ms": 49820,
      "end_ms": 54440,
      "text": "交通部的命令也到了修桥可摆在毛以生，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14cd34bc9dfbf0fb_s00017",
      "start_ms": 54440,
      "end_ms": 56680,
      "text": "面前的是一个烂摊子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14cd34bc9dfbf0fb_s00018",
      "start_ms": 56920,
      "end_ms": 58540,
      "text": "而且是三重烂摊子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14cd34bc9dfbf0fb_s00019",
      "start_ms": 58720,
      "end_ms": 60360,
      "text": "第一重无五孔，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14cd34bc9dfbf0fb_s00020",
      "start_ms": 60380,
      "end_ms": 64545,
      "text": "钢良在江底躺了八九年了得一段一段打捞上来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14cd34bc9dfbf0fb_s00021",
      "start_ms": 64980,
      "end_ms": 66015,
      "text": "弯了的矫正，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14cd34bc9dfbf0fb_s00022",
      "start_ms": 66320,
      "end_ms": 68740,
      "text": "断了的地方换新的铆钉，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14cd34bc9dfbf0fb_s00023",
      "start_ms": 68760,
      "end_ms": 69995,
      "text": "一颗一颗打回去。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14cd34bc9dfbf0fb_s00024",
      "start_ms": 70840,
      "end_ms": 73760,
      "text": "好在当年设计师十六孔全是等跨，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14cd34bc9dfbf0fb_s00025",
      "start_ms": 73920,
      "end_ms": 76575,
      "text": "每孔六十七米统一制造。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14cd34bc9dfbf0fb_s00026",
      "start_ms": 77580,
      "end_ms": 78625,
      "text": "这时候救了命，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14cd34bc9dfbf0fb_s00027",
      "start_ms": 79540,
      "end_ms": 84795,
      "text": "打捞上来的钢粮能配得上新造的第二重。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14cd34bc9dfbf0fb_s00028",
      "start_ms": 85940,
      "end_ms": 89480,
      "text": "日本人当年凑合休往桥里填，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14cd34bc9dfbf0fb_s00029",
      "start_ms": 89560,
      "end_ms": 90675,
      "text": "劣质砂石，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14cd34bc9dfbf0fb_s00030",
      "start_ms": 91190,
      "end_ms": 91890,
      "text": "结歪斜，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14cd34bc9dfbf0fb_s00031",
      "start_ms": 91890,
      "end_ms": 94185,
      "text": "钢梁全得拆掉重来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14cd34bc9dfbf0fb_s00032",
      "start_ms": 94900,
      "end_ms": 96015,
      "text": "日本人干的活，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14cd34bc9dfbf0fb_s00033",
      "start_ms": 96380,
      "end_ms": 97615,
      "text": "毛以生看不上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14cd34bc9dfbf0fb_s00034",
      "start_ms": 97890,
      "end_ms": 98985,
      "text": "必须推倒重来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14cd34bc9dfbf0fb_s00035",
      "start_ms": 99960,
      "end_ms": 101425,
      "text": "第三重最要命。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14cd34bc9dfbf0fb_s00036",
      "start_ms": 101840,
      "end_ms": 102520,
      "text": "五号六号，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14cd34bc9dfbf0fb_s00037",
      "start_ms": 102520,
      "end_ms": 107855,
      "text": "墩伤在水下钱塘江水急潮翻涌，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14cd34bc9dfbf0fb_s00038",
      "start_ms": 108400,
      "end_ms": 110145,
      "text": "怎么在水下修桥墩？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14cd34bc9dfbf0fb_s00039",
      "start_ms": 111080,
      "end_ms": 111640,
      "text": "这时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14cd34bc9dfbf0fb_s00040",
      "start_ms": 111640,
      "end_ms": 117930,
      "text": "毛以生的团队总工程师汪菊潜带着一批年轻人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14cd34bc9dfbf0fb_s00041",
      "start_ms": 117970,
      "end_ms": 119890,
      "text": "硬是发明了套箱法，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14cd34bc9dfbf0fb_s00042",
      "start_ms": 120090,
      "end_ms": 122730,
      "text": "做一个巨大的钢筋混凝土箱子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14cd34bc9dfbf0fb_s00043",
      "start_ms": 122730,
      "end_ms": 123385,
      "text": "沉下去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14cd34bc9dfbf0fb_s00044",
      "start_ms": 123690,
      "end_ms": 124785,
      "text": "把桥墩套住，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14cd34bc9dfbf0fb_s00045",
      "start_ms": 125110,
      "end_ms": 125745,
      "text": "排干水，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14cd34bc9dfbf0fb_s00046",
      "start_ms": 126140,
      "end_ms": 129005,
      "text": "在无水的房间里修复墩身。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14cd34bc9dfbf0fb_s00047",
      "start_ms": 129680,
      "end_ms": 132975,
      "text": "你想想那个画面几十米深的江底，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14cd34bc9dfbf0fb_s00048",
      "start_ms": 133250,
      "end_ms": 134470,
      "text": "一个巨大的箱子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14cd34bc9dfbf0fb_s00049",
      "start_ms": 134470,
      "end_ms": 136735,
      "text": "把桥墩罩住水排干了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14cd34bc9dfbf0fb_s00050",
      "start_ms": 137350,
      "end_ms": 140275,
      "text": "工人在里面像在陆地上一样施工，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14cd34bc9dfbf0fb_s00051",
      "start_ms": 140760,
      "end_ms": 142455,
      "text": "外面是滔滔江水，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14cd34bc9dfbf0fb_s00052",
      "start_ms": 142780,
      "end_ms": 145925,
      "text": "里面是汗花似溅这套技术，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14cd34bc9dfbf0fb_s00053",
      "start_ms": 146300,
      "end_ms": 151955,
      "text": "后来成了中国桥梁修水下桥墩的看家本领。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14cd34bc9dfbf0fb_s00054",
      "start_ms": 152560,
      "end_ms": 153325,
      "text": "直到今天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14cd34bc9dfbf0fb_s00055",
      "start_ms": 153890,
      "end_ms": 158385,
      "text": "中国修水下桥墩用的还是这套思路的升级版。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14cd34bc9dfbf0fb_s00056",
      "start_ms": 159800,
      "end_ms": 161125,
      "text": "一九四七年三月，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14cd34bc9dfbf0fb_s00057",
      "start_ms": 161540,
      "end_ms": 162895,
      "text": "大桥临时通车，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14cd34bc9dfbf0fb_s00058",
      "start_ms": 163760,
      "end_ms": 167235,
      "text": "一九四八年五月正式开始修复。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14cd34bc9dfbf0fb_s00059",
      "start_ms": 168700,
      "end_ms": 169635,
      "text": "注意这个时间，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14cd34bc9dfbf0fb_s00060",
      "start_ms": 170010,
      "end_ms": 172175,
      "text": "从设计到炸毁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14cd34bc9dfbf0fb_s00061",
      "start_ms": 172500,
      "end_ms": 175295,
      "text": "再到修复三个关键节点，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14cd34bc9dfbf0fb_s00062",
      "start_ms": 175680,
      "end_ms": 180410,
      "text": "全是毛蚁生亲自修复完的世界桥梁。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14cd34bc9dfbf0fb_s00063",
      "start_ms": 180430,
      "end_ms": 184485,
      "text": "史上找不出第二个人自己设计的桥，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14cd34bc9dfbf0fb_s00064",
      "start_ms": 184870,
      "end_ms": 185595,
      "text": "自己炸的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14cd34bc9dfbf0fb_s00065",
      "start_ms": 186050,
      "end_ms": 187255,
      "text": "自己再修回来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14cd34bc9dfbf0fb_s00066",
      "start_ms": 188370,
      "end_ms": 189725,
      "text": "这不是电影剧本，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14cd34bc9dfbf0fb_s00067",
      "start_ms": 190070,
      "end_ms": 191755,
      "text": "这是真实发生的事儿。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14cd34bc9dfbf0fb_s00068",
      "start_ms": 192850,
      "end_ms": 194995,
      "text": "可你以为这就完了没有？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14cd34bc9dfbf0fb_s00069",
      "start_ms": 197010,
      "end_ms": 198475,
      "text": "一九四九年五月，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14cd34bc9dfbf0fb_s00070",
      "start_ms": 198780,
      "end_ms": 203085,
      "text": "杭州在被解放前夕撤退的军队又炸了一次。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14cd34bc9dfbf0fb_s00071",
      "start_ms": 203590,
      "end_ms": 207415,
      "text": "好在地下党员和护桥工人拼死保护，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14cd34bc9dfbf0fb_s00072",
      "start_ms": 207880,
      "end_ms": 209545,
      "text": "只炸毁了部分铁轨。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14cd34bc9dfbf0fb_s00073",
      "start_ms": 210110,
      "end_ms": 212430,
      "text": "大桥主体保住了新中国，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14cd34bc9dfbf0fb_s00074",
      "start_ms": 212430,
      "end_ms": 214425,
      "text": "成立后继续修复。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14cd34bc9dfbf0fb_s00075",
      "start_ms": 215440,
      "end_ms": 217900,
      "text": "一九五三年九月六号，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14cd34bc9dfbf0fb_s00076",
      "start_ms": 217900,
      "end_ms": 222575,
      "text": "墩彻底修完嗯一九五四年大桥全面恢复使用，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14cd34bc9dfbf0fb_s00077",
      "start_ms": 223080,
      "end_ms": 226570,
      "text": "从一九三四年开工到一九五四年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14cd34bc9dfbf0fb_s00078",
      "start_ms": 226590,
      "end_ms": 228695,
      "text": "全面恢复整整二十年。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14cd34bc9dfbf0fb_s00079",
      "start_ms": 229230,
      "end_ms": 232125,
      "text": "一座桥折腾了二十年之久，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14cd34bc9dfbf0fb_s00080",
      "start_ms": 232750,
      "end_ms": 235345,
      "text": "而毛以生的故事还在继续。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14cd34bc9dfbf0fb_s00081",
      "start_ms": 235920,
      "end_ms": 237225,
      "text": "新中国成立后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14cd34bc9dfbf0fb_s00082",
      "start_ms": 237720,
      "end_ms": 241775,
      "text": "毛以生又主持了武汉长江大桥的技术工作。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14cd34bc9dfbf0fb_s00083",
      "start_ms": 242400,
      "end_ms": 245995,
      "text": "万里长江第一桥在他手里架了起来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14cd34bc9dfbf0fb_s00084",
      "start_ms": 246870,
      "end_ms": 251095,
      "text": "从此京汉铁路和粤汉铁路连成一线，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14cd34bc9dfbf0fb_s00085",
      "start_ms": 251600,
      "end_ms": 254805,
      "text": "整个中国的南北动脉被全面打通了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14cd34bc9dfbf0fb_s00086",
      "start_ms": 255750,
      "end_ms": 256190,
      "text": "后来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14cd34bc9dfbf0fb_s00087",
      "start_ms": 256430,
      "end_ms": 258045,
      "text": "人民大会堂的建设，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14cd34bc9dfbf0fb_s00088",
      "start_ms": 258410,
      "end_ms": 260735,
      "text": "中国铁道科学研究院的组建，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14cd34bc9dfbf0fb_s00089",
      "start_ms": 261210,
      "end_ms": 263325,
      "text": "上百万字的科普著作，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14cd34bc9dfbf0fb_s00090",
      "start_ms": 263700,
      "end_ms": 266565,
      "text": "毛以生都注入了大量心血。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14cd34bc9dfbf0fb_s00091",
      "start_ms": 267210,
      "end_ms": 272920,
      "text": "一九八七年九十一岁的毛以生递交了入党申请书，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14cd34bc9dfbf0fb_s00092",
      "start_ms": 273120,
      "end_ms": 274375,
      "text": "他在申请书里写，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14cd34bc9dfbf0fb_s00093",
      "start_ms": 274830,
      "end_ms": 276345,
      "text": "我已年逾九十，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14cd34bc9dfbf0fb_s00094",
      "start_ms": 276850,
      "end_ms": 279345,
      "text": "能为党工作之日日短，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14cd34bc9dfbf0fb_s00095",
      "start_ms": 279750,
      "end_ms": 281630,
      "text": "而要求入党之殷切，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14cd34bc9dfbf0fb_s00096",
      "start_ms": 281710,
      "end_ms": 283295,
      "text": "愿望与日俱增。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14cd34bc9dfbf0fb_s00097",
      "start_ms": 284230,
      "end_ms": 284945,
      "text": "两年后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14cd34bc9dfbf0fb_s00098",
      "start_ms": 285190,
      "end_ms": 287265,
      "text": "一九八九年十一月十二日，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14cd34bc9dfbf0fb_s00099",
      "start_ms": 287730,
      "end_ms": 288985,
      "text": "毛以身世事，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14cd34bc9dfbf0fb_s00100",
      "start_ms": 289410,
      "end_ms": 290845,
      "text": "享年九十三岁。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14cd34bc9dfbf0fb_s00101",
      "start_ms": 291390,
      "end_ms": 292385,
      "text": "二零零六年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14cd34bc9dfbf0fb_s00102",
      "start_ms": 292640,
      "end_ms": 296345,
      "text": "中国科学院把一颗小行星永久命名为。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14cd34bc9dfbf0fb_s00103",
      "start_ms": 296730,
      "end_ms": 297750,
      "text": "毛蚁生心，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14cd34bc9dfbf0fb_s00104",
      "start_ms": 298370,
      "end_ms": 306110,
      "text": "今天钱塘江大桥依然横跨在钱塘江面上上面跑汽车下面跑火车，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14cd34bc9dfbf0fb_s00105",
      "start_ms": 306390,
      "end_ms": 308270,
      "text": "天天有火车呼啸而过。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14cd34bc9dfbf0fb_s00106",
      "start_ms": 309050,
      "end_ms": 311930,
      "text": "这座桥的设计寿命其实只有五十年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14cd34bc9dfbf0fb_s00107",
      "start_ms": 312070,
      "end_ms": 315150,
      "text": "到今天它已经服役快九十年了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14cd34bc9dfbf0fb_s00108",
      "start_ms": 315670,
      "end_ms": 321970,
      "text": "钱塘江大桥陈列馆里至今摆着一段被打捞上来的钢梁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14cd34bc9dfbf0fb_s00109",
      "start_ms": 322430,
      "end_ms": 325090,
      "text": "断口的痕迹清清楚楚。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14cd34bc9dfbf0fb_s00110",
      "start_ms": 325430,
      "end_ms": 326800,
      "text": "那是历史的商吧，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14cd34bc9dfbf0fb_s00111",
      "start_ms": 327440,
      "end_ms": 328880,
      "text": "也是民族的勋章。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14cd34bc9dfbf0fb_s00112",
      "start_ms": 330020,
      "end_ms": 332300,
      "text": "有人问茅以生，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14cd34bc9dfbf0fb_s00113",
      "start_ms": 332640,
      "end_ms": 334040,
      "text": "这辈子图什么？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14cd34bc9dfbf0fb_s00114",
      "start_ms": 334740,
      "end_ms": 336140,
      "text": "图的就是四个字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14cd34bc9dfbf0fb_s00115",
      "start_ms": 336460,
      "end_ms": 340920,
      "text": "此桥必覆他把这四个字刻进骨头里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14cd34bc9dfbf0fb_s00116",
      "start_ms": 341100,
      "end_ms": 343480,
      "text": "然后用后半辈子证明了一件事，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14cd34bc9dfbf0fb_s00117",
      "start_ms": 343960,
      "end_ms": 347560,
      "text": "中国人能建桥赶炸桥更修的回来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14cd34bc9dfbf0fb_s00118",
      "start_ms": 348160,
      "end_ms": 349940,
      "text": "从钱塘江到长江，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14cd34bc9dfbf0fb_s00119",
      "start_ms": 350120,
      "end_ms": 351500,
      "text": "从内河到跨海，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14cd34bc9dfbf0fb_s00120",
      "start_ms": 352340,
      "end_ms": 353420,
      "text": "今天的中国，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14cd34bc9dfbf0fb_s00121",
      "start_ms": 353740,
      "end_ms": 356445,
      "text": "拥有世界上最长的跨海大桥，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14cd34bc9dfbf0fb_s00122",
      "start_ms": 356530,
      "end_ms": 358075,
      "text": "好最高的桥梁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14cd34bc9dfbf0fb_s00123",
      "start_ms": 358480,
      "end_ms": 359925,
      "text": "最多的特大桥梁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14cd34bc9dfbf0fb_s00124",
      "start_ms": 360880,
      "end_ms": 363145,
      "text": "全球排名前一百的高桥，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14cd34bc9dfbf0fb_s00125",
      "start_ms": 363540,
      "end_ms": 365085,
      "text": "中国战狼八十多岁。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14cd34bc9dfbf0fb_s00126",
      "start_ms": 365640,
      "end_ms": 367395,
      "text": "而这一切的起点，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14cd34bc9dfbf0fb_s00127",
      "start_ms": 367820,
      "end_ms": 371335,
      "text": "就在一九三四年的钱塘江边，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14cd34bc9dfbf0fb_s00128",
      "start_ms": 372170,
      "end_ms": 375905,
      "text": "在那个叫毛以生的人说出我来的那一刻，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14cd34bc9dfbf0fb_s00129",
      "start_ms": 376560,
      "end_ms": 379865,
      "text": "毛以生系列到这儿就全部讲完了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14cd34bc9dfbf0fb_s00130",
      "start_ms": 380270,
      "end_ms": 383385,
      "text": "三座桥一个人一辈子。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14cd34bc9dfbf0fb_s00131",
      "start_ms": 384030,
      "end_ms": 389265,
      "text": "如果你也为这个用一生兑现承诺的老人打动了点个赞，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14cd34bc9dfbf0fb_s00132",
      "start_ms": 389620,
      "end_ms": 392925,
      "text": "收藏起来转发给更多人看看。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14cd34bc9dfbf0fb_s00133",
      "start_ms": 394100,
      "end_ms": 396375,
      "text": "关注我下一个国之脊梁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_14cd34bc9dfbf0fb_s00134",
      "start_ms": 396640,
      "end_ms": 397455,
      "text": "我们继续讲。"
    }
  ],
